{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24360","headline":"与梦得偶同到敦诗宅感而题壁 · 白居易","name":"与梦得偶同到敦诗宅感而题壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山东才副苍生愿，川上俄惊逝水波。\n履道凄凉新第宅，宣城零落旧笙歌。\n园荒唯有薪堪采，门冷兼无雀可罗。\n今日相逢偶同到，伤心不是故经过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}